---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';import {puzzles} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Islamic Concept Connections"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Sixteen terms. Four connections.</span><h1>Which words<br/>belong together?</h1><p>Find four intended groups of four terms. Each revealed group opens a source reading and explains its connection.</p></section><section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Choose a board<select id="board-select">{puzzles.map(p=><option value={p.id}>Board {p.number} · {p.title} · {p.level}</option>)}</select></label><label><input id="remember" type="checkbox"/> Remember this board for 30 days</label><button class="button secondary" id="new-board">Next board</button><button class="text-button" id="restart">Restart</button></div></section><div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="board-title">Your connections</h2><span id="progress" class="pill">0 of 4 groups</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div id="solved" class="solved-groups"></div><div id="tiles" class="tiles" role="group" aria-label="Term tiles"></div><p id="feedback" role="status" class="top-gap">Choose four terms, then check the group.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button" id="submit">Check group</button><button class="button secondary" id="deselect">Deselect</button><button class="button secondary" id="shuffle">Shuffle</button><button class="button secondary" id="hint">Show a hint</button><button class="text-button" id="reveal">Reveal all groups</button></div><div class="actions top-gap"><span id="stats" class="micro"></span><button class="text-button" id="share">Copy board link</button></div></div></section><aside class="sidebar"><div class="notice"><h2>A grouping puzzle</h2><p>Some words can have more than one connection. Find this board’s intended groups, then inspect the cited readings.</p><p>“One away” means three selected terms belong to one intended group. You can retry as often as you like.</p><a href="/sources/">Source notes ↗</a></div></aside></div><section id="explanations" class="top-gap" aria-live="polite"></section><noscript><p class="noscript">The grouping activity requires JavaScript. Source references remain available on the Sources page.</p></noscript><script>import '../lib/app';</script></Shell>
